    },
    "A Mac window, its title bar always shown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jendela Mac, dengan title bar yang selalu tampil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A PIN has digits only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PIN hanya berisi angka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A chosen place" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tempat pilihan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A copy of “%@”, with its controls: type its name in its tab." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salinan “%@” beserta kontrolnya: ketik namanya di tabnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A finger Android does not know: the app or lock screen does not recognize it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jari yang tidak dikenal Android: aplikasi atau layar kunci tidak mengenalinya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A joystick follows a stick or the d-pad." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Joystick mengikuti stik atau d-pad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A light pulse when a button touches the screen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Getaran ringan saat tombol menyentuh layar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mode is another set of controls for another situation in the game (on foot, in a vehicle, an inventory). A Switch control changes to it with a key or a controller button." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mode adalah kumpulan kontrol lain untuk situasi lain di game (jalan kaki, di kendaraan, inventaris). Kontrol Ganti berpindah ke sana dengan tombol keyboard atau tombol kontroler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new mode and its Switch: name the mode, then press the Switch’s key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mode baru dan Gantinya: beri nama mode, lalu tekan tombol untuk Ganti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new mode, empty: add its controls." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mode baru, masih kosong: tambahkan kontrolnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A route" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sebuah rute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stick drives a joystick or the eye. To use pressing it down (%@) here, press the stick down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stik menggerakkan joystick atau mata. Untuk memakai tekanan stik (%@) di sini, tekan stiknya ke bawah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A stick drives a joystick or the eye; drop it on the game to place one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stik menggerakkan joystick atau mata; lepaskan di game untuk menaruhnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tap on %@, together with %@. Click the next button of the game and press its key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A tap on %1$@, together with %2$@. Click the next button of the game and press its key."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketuk dengan %1$@, bersama %2$@. Klik tombol game berikutnya, lalu tekan tombolnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tap on %@. Click the next button of the game and press its key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketuk dengan %@. Klik tombol game berikutnya, lalu tekan tombolnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
